    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="b4be4ee2-6704-518a-99d0-640c38e70705" activityNameId="fdff3fa0-ea73-5750-a5e7-21fbe44b1d10" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maize seed IP, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maize seed IP, at farm
Refers to 1 kg maize seed (fresh weight with 12% humidity). The grain yield is 3000 kg/ha.;
UUID: 4277f9d6-1fd4-3cec-bc96-4a11f45ea98f
The inventory describes the production of maize seed on the field. Included are sowing, fertilisation, plant protection and the harvest as well as direct field emissions and land use. The transports of the inputs to the farm are included. The system boundary is at the farm gate.
Location: Values refer to the situation in Switzerland.
Technology: Integrated production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Maize seed production CH 507t, consumption CH 1557t in 1999-2000
Sampling: Data derived from literature, recommendations and expert information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4277f9d6-1fd4-3cec-bc96-4a11f45ea98f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
